    </a>
                                        <h2>Campus locations</h2>
                  
    <div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6">      <div class="imageOuter">
                          <img src="/system/files/123591/map_500.jpg" alt="Japan map" />


        
    </div>
  
</div><div class="col-sm-6">      <div class="imageOuter">
                          <img src="/system/files/123592/location_500.jpg" alt="campus locations" />


        
    </div>
  
</div></div><ul class="linksList nonStandardStyleList">                                                                          <li><a target="_blank" href="/system/files/123593/map_en.pdf" class="linkIcon_pdf">Full size map（443.78 KB）</a></li>
          
    </ul>                                    <h2>Campuses</h2>
                                    <div class="contentText"><p>Hiroshima University has its main campus located in Higashihiroshima city, coupled with other two campuses in Hiroshima city.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access#higashihiroshima">Higashi-Hiroshima campus</a> (Higashihiroshima city)</li>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access#kasumi">Kasumi campus</a> (Hiroshima city)</li>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access#higashisenda">Higashi-Senda campus</a> (Hiroshima city)<a class="ck-anchor" id="higashihiroshima" name="higashihiroshima"></a></li>
</ul>
</div>
        
                                        <h3>Higashi-Hiroshima campus</h3>
                                    <div class="contentText"><p>Address: 1-3-2 Kagamiyama, Higashi-Hiroshima City, Hiroshima, Japan 739-8511 (<a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/higashihiroshima">Directions</a>)</p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<p><strong>Higashi-Hiroshima campus comprises of the following:</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<ul>
<li>Administration Bureau</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Integrated Arts and Sciences, Letters, Education, Economics (Daytime course), Science, Engineering, Applied Biological Science, Informatics and Data Science</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Graduate Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Integrated Arts and Sciences, Letters, Education, Social Sciences (Department of Law and Politics, Department of Economics), Science, Advanced Sciences of Matter, Engineering, International Development and Cooperation, Integrated Sciences for Life</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Facilities</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Hiroshima Synchrotron Radiation Center, Research Institute for Nanodevice and Bio Systems, Amphibian Research Center etc.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/higashihiroshima">Directions to Higashi-Hiroshima campus</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/higashihiroshima/map_higashihiroshima">Higashi-Hiroshima campus map</a><a class="ck-anchor" id="kasumi" name="kasumi"></a></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
        
                                        <h3>Kasumi campus and&nbsp;Hiroshima University Hospital</h3>
                                    <div class="contentText"><p>Address: 1-2-3 Kasumi, Minami-ku, Hiroshima City, Hiroshima, Japan 734-8551 (<a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/kasumi">Directions</a>)</p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<p><strong>Kasumi campus comprises of the following:</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<ul>
<li>Hiroshima University Hospital</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>​Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>​Medicine, Dentistry, Pharmaceutical Sciences</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Graduate Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Biomedical and Health Sciences</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Facilities</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Research Institute for Radiation Biology and Medicine</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/kasumi">Directions to Kasumi campus</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/kasumi/map_kasumi">Kasumi campus map</a><a class="ck-anchor" id="higashisenda" name="higashisenda"></a></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
        
                                        <h3>Higashi-Senda campus</h3>
                                    <div class="contentText"><p>Address: 1-1-89 Higashi-Senda-machi, Naka-ku, Hiroshima City, Hiroshima, Japan 730-0053 (<a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/senda">Directions</a>)</p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<p><strong>Higashi-Senda campus comprises of the following:</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>​Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>​Law , Economics (Main evening course)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Graduate Schools</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Social Sciences (Department of Management Studies), Hiroshima University Law School</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<ul>
<li>Facilities</li>
</ul>
</td>
<td>
<p>Higashi-Senda Innovative Research Center, The Center for Peace</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/senda">Directions to Higashi-Senda campus</a></li>
<li><a href="http://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/senda/map_senda">Higashi-Senda campus map</a><a class="ck-anchor" id="campus_locations" name="campus_locations"></a></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
        
    <ul class="linksList nonStandardStyleList">        <li class="link-1">
    <a href="https://www.hiroshima-u.ac.jp/en/access/hiroshima">
      For more detailed directions to Hiroshima, please refer to this page.
    </a>
  </li>
</ul>
</div>

